        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="note"><b>Same-family verbs:</b> <span class="es">querer</span>, <span class="es">empezar</span>, <span class="es">preferir</span> (e→ie); <span class="es">dormir</span>, <span class="es">volver</span>, <span class="es">encontrar</span>, <span class="es">jugar</span> (o→ue, and <span class="es">jugar</span> u→ue); <span class="es">servir</span>, <span class="es">repetir</span> (e→i). The nosotros/vosotros forms <b>never</b> change — that's the top of the boot.</p>
